C: Version 4.9.5.5
C: * New option in Editor Options: Show editor hints. User can disable the =
C: hints
C:   displayed in the editor when the mouse moves over a word. Since this =
C: was the
C:   cause of many errors (although it should be fixed by now), we are =
C: giving the
C:   user the option to disable this featu
C: re.
C: * New option in Editor Options (code-completion): Use code-completion =
C: cache.
C:   Well, it adds caching to code-completion. Depending on the cache size,
C:   the program may take a bit longer to start-up, but provides very fast
C:   code-completion and the user has all the commands (belonging to the =
C: files
C:   he added in the cache) at his fingertips. If, for example, the user =
